<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/46/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The National Wages Consultative Council Act 2011 [Act 732] is amended in section 2 by substituting for the definition of “contract of service” the following definition: ‘ “contract of service” has the same meaning assigned to it in section 2 of the Employment Act 1955 [Act 265], section 2 of the Sabah Labour Ordinance [Cap. 67] and section 2 of the Sarawak Labour Ordinance [Cap. 76];’."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/46/eng@> .
